# 1️⃣ Quick Revision

### Number System

* Prime number → Exactly 2 factors
* HCF × LCM = Product of numbers

### Simplification

* Follow **BODMAS**
* Learn squares (1–30) and cubes (1–20)

### Percentage

* 25% = 1/4
* 50% = 1/2
* 75% = 3/4

### Average

* Average = Sum ÷ Number of Terms

### SI & CI

* SI = (P × R × T)/100
* CI = A − P

### Time & Work

* Work = Rate × Time

### Speed & Distance

* Distance = Speed × Time

